@startuml
!theme plain
hide footbox

skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam wrapWidth 200
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow false
skinparam shadowing false

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #333333
    LifeLineBorderColor #666666
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #F0F0F0
    ParticipantBorderColor #333333
    ParticipantFontColor #000000
    ActorBackgroundColor #FFF3E0
    ActorBorderColor #333333
    NoteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
    NoteBorderColor #FBC02D
}

skinparam participant {
    BackgroundColor<<Presentation>> #E3F2FD
    BorderColor<<Presentation>> #1565C0
    BackgroundColor<<Application>> #E8F5E9
    BorderColor<<Application>> #2E7D32
    BackgroundColor<<Infrastructure>> #E1F5FE
    BorderColor<<Infrastructure>> #0277BD
}

title Diagrama de Secuencia — API Extractor de PDFs (Clean Architecture)

actor "Cliente HTTP" as User
participant "API\nroutes.py" as API <<Presentation>>
participant "ProcesarDocumento\nUseCase" as UC <<Application>>
participant "CRUD\nUseCases" as CRUD <<Application>>
participant "Checksum\nCalculator" as Checksum <<Infrastructure>>
participant "PyPDF\nExtractor" as Extractor <<Infrastructure>>
participant "Mongo\nRepository" as Repo <<Infrastructure>>
database "MongoDB" as Mongo

note over API, UC: create_app() publica dependencias; Depends() arma el caso de uso.\nSanitización y validación PDF: app/core/security.

== POST /upload — ProcesarDocumentoUseCase ==
User -> API : POST /upload (multipart PDF)
activate API
API -> API : leer bytes en RAM
API -> UC : execute(filename, bytes, size)
activate UC
UC -> UC : validar tamaño / nombre / PDF
alt Validación falla
    UC --> API : DomainException (400/413)
    note right of UC: 413 tamaño / 400 nombre / 400 formato
    API --> User : 4xx {"detail": mensaje}
else Validación OK
    UC -> Checksum : calculate(bytes)
    Checksum --> UC : sha256
    UC -> Repo : obtener_por_checksum(sha256)
    Repo -> Mongo : find_one({hash_seguridad})
    Mongo --> Repo : documento | None
    Repo --> UC : Documento | None
    alt Documento duplicado
        UC --> API : DocumentoDuplicadoError (409)
        API --> User : 409 {"detail": mensaje}
    else Documento nuevo
        UC -> Extractor : extract(BytesIO)
        Extractor --> UC : texto_markdown
        note right of Extractor: 422 si pypdf falla
        UC -> UC : sanitize_text(texto)
        UC -> Repo : guardar_documento(Documento)
        Repo -> Mongo : insert_one(documento)
        Mongo --> Repo : resultado
        Repo --> UC : ok
        UC --> API : ResultadoDocumento
        API -> API : UploadResponse(...)
        API --> User : 200 {"status": "success", ...}
    end
end
deactivate UC
deactivate API

== CRUD — Listar / Obtener / Actualizar / Eliminar ==
User -> API : GET/PUT/DELETE /documentos...
activate API
API -> CRUD : <UseCase>.execute(...)
CRUD -> CRUD : validar checksum / existencia\nsanitize_filename (PUT)
CRUD -> Repo : listar / obtener / actualizar / eliminar
Repo -> Mongo : find / update_one / delete_one
Repo --> CRUD : Documento(s) | ok
CRUD --> API : DTO / resultado
API -> API : DTO de respuesta
API --> User : 200 / 400 / 404
deactivate API
note right of CRUD: 400 checksum/nombre inválido\n404 no encontrado

== GET /health ==
User -> API : GET /health
activate API
API -> Repo : ping()
Repo -> Mongo : admin.command("ping")
Repo --> API : ok | excepción
API --> User : 200 healthy | 503 unhealthy
deactivate API

note over API: DomainException -> exception_handlers.py -> JSON {"detail": mensaje}.

legend right
  **Capas**
  Azul: presentación (FastAPI)
  Verde: aplicación (casos de uso)
  Celeste: infraestructura (adaptadores)
  Dominio: Documento + excepciones
end legend
@enduml
